        "text": "To simplify a surd, find the largest perfect square factor:\n\n$72 = 36 \\times 2$ (36 is a perfect square)\n$18 = 9 \\times 2$ (9 is a perfect square)\n$50 = 25 \\times 2$ (25 is a perfect square)",
