        "text": "Use $\\sqrt{a \\times b} = \\sqrt{a} \\times \\sqrt{b}$:\n\n$\\sqrt{72} = \\sqrt{36} \\times \\sqrt{2} = 6\\sqrt{2}$\n$\\sqrt{18} = \\sqrt{9} \\times \\sqrt{2} = 3\\sqrt{2}$\n$\\sqrt{50} = \\sqrt{25} \\times \\sqrt{2} = 5\\sqrt{2}$",
